<title>UK: BOE gives money mkt 463 mln stg help at set rates.</title>
<headline>BOE gives money mkt 463 mln stg help at set rates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it bought bills/FRG totalling 463 million stg at the established interest rate of 5-31/32 percent.</p>
<p>			    EARLY	1200 GMT   1400 GMT   LATE</p>
<p> FORECAST SHORTAGE    1.4 BLN    =	    =	    =</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE SUPPLY    463 MLN    =	    =	    =</p>
<p> DETAILS</p>
<p> BILLS/FRG TO FEB 10  463 MLN#   =	    =	     =</p>
<p> # INTEREST RATE - 5-31/32 PCT (INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE RATES)</p>
</text>
